<%- include('partials/head') %><header class="page-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">CHECK THE DETAILS</p><h1><%= a.filename %></h1><p>Import #<%= a.id %> <span class="badge <%= a.status %>"><%= a.status %></span></p></div><a class="button secondary" href="/imports">← All imports</a></header><% if(a.errors?.length){ %><section class="notice error" role="alert"><strong>This import needs attention</strong><ul><% a.errors.forEach(e=>{ %><li><strong><%= e.field %>:</strong> <%= e.message %></li><% }) %></ul></section><% } %><div class="review-grid"><section class="panel document-panel"><div class="panel-heading"><h2>Original document</h2><% if(a.storage_name){ %><a href="/imports/<%= a.id %>/document" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open PDF ↗</a><% } %></div><% if(a.storage_name){ %><iframe title="Original payslip PDF" src="/imports/<%= a.id %>/document"></iframe><% }else{ %><div class="empty">Download has not completed. Retry to request another sync.</div><% } %></section><section class="panel"><h2>Extracted details</h2><p>Check the printed pay date: it determines the tax year, including back pay. For locum or bank work without an annual salary, use employment type <strong>ad_hoc</strong> and leave salary blank. Add or remove pay and deduction lines in the JSON editor. Refund deductions are negative amounts; an R suffix is also accepted.</p><% if(previous){ %><details class="comparison"><summary>Compare with the current saved version</summary><dl><dt>Pay date</dt><dd><%= date(previous.pay_date) %></dd><dt>Gross pay</dt><dd><%= gbp(previous.total_payments) %></dd><dt>Deductions</dt><dd><%= gbp(previous.total_deductions) %></dd><dt>Net pay</dt><dd><%= gbp(previous.net_pay) %></dd></dl><a href="/view_payslip?payslip_id=<%= previous.id %>">View all current details →</a></details><% } %><% if(a.draft && !['saved','duplicate'].includes(a.status)){ %><form action="/imports/<%= a.id %>/review" method="post" id="review-form"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrf %>"><div id="field-editor"></div><details id="raw-editor"><summary>Advanced: edit extracted JSON</summary><label>Parsed payslip<textarea name="draft" id="draft" rows="24" spellcheck="false"><%= JSON.stringify(a.draft,null,2) %></textarea></label></details><label class="check"><input type="checkbox" name="confirm" value="yes"> I checked the PDF and confirm replacement if the identity or pay date changed, or an existing payslip matches.</label><button class="button">Validate & save</button></form><% }else if(a.draft){ %><dl><dt>Pay date</dt><dd><%= date(a.draft.pay_date) %></dd><dt>Take-home pay</dt><dd><%= gbp(a.draft.net_pay) %></dd></dl><p>This import is complete.</p><a href="/payslip_table">Open your library →</a><% }else{ %><p>No reliable draft could be extracted. Check that this is an original NHS ESR PDF, then retry or upload a corrected file.</p><% } %><% if(!['saved','duplicate'].includes(a.status)){ %><form action="/imports/<%= a.id %>/retry" method="post" class="retry"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrf %>"><button class="button secondary">Retry original</button></form><% } %></section></div><%- include('partials/foot') %>
